"OrganisationOrganisationi1.OrganisationOrganisation NameCountryUnited KingdomSelect a country, for example United States of AmericaAustraliaCanadaIrelandNew ZealandUnited KingdomUnited States of AmericaOtherAddressUnit 4, Hackney Wick Maker Yard, 92 Wallis Road London E9 5LNLegal FormiPrivate Company Limited by Shares (Ltd)Select a legal formSole TraderPartnershipLimited Liability Partnership (LLP)Private Company Limited by Shares (Ltd)Private Company Limited by GuaranteeCommunity Interest Company (CIC)Registration DateiOpening DateiActivitiesiPrimarySIC 13921NotesiLumen & Loom Studio Ltd is a London-based textile design studio, founded in 2025 by Maya Chen, Oliver Grant and Priya Shah and based at a shared workshop in Hackney Wick, East London. We design and handweave sustainable home textiles (cushions, throws, table linen and wall hangings) from British wool, organic cotton and recycled yarns. Alongside our own collection we run small-group weaving workshops and take bespoke commissions for interior designers and boutique hotels.Back‹›Back
