London
E9 5LN | 03/02/2025 | 04/01/2025 | Lumen & Loom Studio Ltd is a London-based textile design studio, founded in 2025 by Maya Chen, Oliver Grant and Priya Shah and based at a shared workshop in Hackney Wick, East London. We design and handweave sustainable home textiles (cushions, throws, table linen and wall hangings) from British wool, organic cotton and recycled yarns. Alongside our own collection we run small-group weaving workshops and take bespoke commissions for interior designers and boutique hotels."
