[fields] Lumen & Loom Studio Ltd was incorporated in March 2025 by Maya Chen, Oliver Grant and Priya Shah and opened its Hackney Wick studio in April 2025. We sell a handwoven homeware collection online and at London markets, run beginner weaving workshops, and are starting bespoke commissions and a trade collection for interior designers and boutique hotels. Customers find us through Instagram, markets, word of mouth and design fairs. We are funded by £13,000 of founders’ capital, a £25,000 Start Up Loan and an £8,000 Hackney grant (half received at the opening). Monthly fixed costs are about £7,300, mostly three modest director salaries and rent; revenue starts small and is expected to cover costs from November 2025. To close a funding gap of about £14,200 before then, we are raising £20,000 from angels under SEIS (closing in August 2025) and £6,000 on Kickstarter in May 2025."
